 ## Configuration Repos
 
 Edit `bendrucker/claude` at `~/src/bendrucker/claude`. `claude-sync` updates `~/.claude-repo` from `main`, so a merged change goes live only after that sync runs. Dotfiles are deployed at `~/.dotfiles`.
 
